    "In morning brought in",
    "the bears.",
    "In afternoon M. &",
    "I went out on foot",
    "again with moccasins",
    "as usual. We found",
    "a big grizzly at",
    "the carcass of the",
    "bull elk; M. has not",
    "yet got one solely[?]",
    "to[?] his own gun,",
    "so I made him",
    "shoot it.",
